## Data Relations 🔍

### Returns Relations

- **`order`** → `orders` (Many-to-One)
- **`customer`** → `customers` (Many-to-One)
- **`fulfillment`** → `fulfillments` (Many-to-One, optional)
- **`location`** → `locations` (Many-to-One, optional)
- **`market_currency`** → `market_currencies` (Many-to-One) - Stored from order for reference
- **`refund_payment_id`** → `payments` (Many-to-One, optional)

### Return Items Relations

- **`return`** → `returns` (Many-to-One)
- **`order_item`** → `order_item` (Many-to-One)
- **`variant`** → `product_variants` (Many-to-One)
- **`exchange_for_variant`** → `product_variants` (Many-to-One, optional)

