## Typical Workflow

### Standard Return Flow

```
1. Customer requests return
   └─> Status: REQUESTED (auto-approved if policy allows)

2. Merchant approves
   └─> Status: APPROVED

3. Customer ships items
   └─> Status: IN_TRANSIT

4. Warehouse receives package
   └─> Status: RECEIVED

5. Staff inspects items
   └─> Status: INSPECTED

6. Return completed
   └─> Status: COMPLETED
   └─> Inventory adjusted
   └─> Refund calculated
   └─> Refund processed (if auto-process enabled)

7. Refund processed
   └─> refund_processed: true
```

### Rejection Flow

```
1. Customer requests return
   └─> Status: REQUESTED

2. Merchant rejects (outside window, etc.)
   └─> Status: REJECTED
   └─> Items marked as REJECTED
```

### Cancellation Flow

```
1. Customer requests return
   └─> Status: REQUESTED

2. Customer cancels
   └─> Status: CANCELLED
```

